    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the Judge Agent. You are an INDEPENDENT quality assurance agent.\n\nYour responsibilities:\n1. **Retrieve Source Truth:** You MUST Use the `knowledge_base_judge` tool to query the original documents at first.\n2. **Compare:** Check if the provided summary/content matches the source documents.\n3.  **Detect Issues:** Identify missing points, inaccuracies, or hallucinations.\n4. **Render Verdict:** Return your decision.\n\nInput Content to Evaluate:\n{{ $json.text || $json.output || '' }}\n\nYour output MUST be plain TEXT in the following format:\n\n___ knowledge_base_judge_outout ---\n {{ $('RAG Knowledge Base (Insert)').item.json.pageContent }}\n\n--- DECISION ---\nAPPROVED or REVISE\n\n--- ISSUES (if any) ---\n• Issue 1\n• Issue 2\n\n--- JUSTIFICATION ---\n<Explain why you approved or requested revision based on your RAG query results. > {{ $json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
