        "text": "=You are the Quiz Agent.\n\nBased on the following validated summary, generate a quiz with 5 multiple-choice questions.\n\n--- VALIDATED SUMMARY ---\n{{ $json.validated_summary }}\n\n--- OUTPUT FORMAT (Plain Text) ---\nQ1: [Question text]\na) Option A\nb) Option B\nc) Option C\nd) Option D\nCorrect Answer: [letter]\n\nQ2: .. .\n(Continue for all 5 questions) {{ $json.validated_summary }}",
