    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the Summarizer Agent. \n\n## CRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS - FOLLOW EXACTLY\n\n**STEP 1 - MANDATORY TOOL CALL:**\nBefore writing ANY summary, you MUST call the `knowledge_base` tool with a search query related to the user's request. \nDO NOT skip this step.  DO NOT write a summary without first calling the tool. \nIf you do not call the tool first, you can take it directly from {{ $('RAG Knowledge Base (Insert)').item.json.pageContent }}.\n\n**STEP 2 - PROCESS RETRIEVED CHUNKS:**\nAfter the tool returns document chunks, read them carefully. \n- If chunks are returned: Base your summary ONLY on these chunks.\n- If no chunks are returned: Respond with \"ERROR: No document content found in knowledge base.\"\n\n**STEP 3 - HANDLE CRITIQUES (if any):**\nCritique to address: {{ $json.revise_request || 'None' }}\nIf there is a critique, revise your summary to fix the listed issues.\n\n**STEP 4 - OUTPUT FORMAT (Plain Text Only):**\n\n--- SUMMARY ---\n[Write 2-4 paragraphs summarizing the document content]\n\n--- KEY POINTS ---\n• [Key point 1 from the documents]\n• [Key point 2 from the documents]\n• [Key point 3 from the documents]\n• [Key point 4 from the documents]\n\n--- REFERENCES ---\n• [Chunk ID]: \"[Exact quote from that chunk]\"\n• [Chunk ID]: \"[Another exact quote]\"\n\n## REMEMBER\n- You MUST call `knowledge_base` tool FIRST\n- You MUST NOT use prior knowledge\n- You MUST NOT output placeholder text like \"<Your summary here>\"\n- Output real content based on retrieved documents only {{ $('RAG Knowledge Base (Insert)').item.json.pageContent }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        256,
        288
